# The chain boss's pattern (Kind75Start, $84:87D1, run by the eighth piece,
# the kind $74 record at $0E7B on this play): the parts no
# play reaches. The play of rand_stage_a5_s3 (seed 7) to frame 2100, the
# chain sweeping by then. Pokes:
# - the piece's x high byte ($0E87) to $70: the next sweep frame clamps it
#   at the left edge ($84:88AF);
# - CHAIN_ROUND ($1B1D) to 3: the round after the next head turn wraps to
#   0 ($84:8840);
# - frame 2600, HEAD_TURNS ($1B33) to 3: the own turn at round 0 is the
#   fourth, which goes on as the long turn ($84:8958);
# - frame 2990 (a sweep), CHAIN_ROUND 0 and CHAIN_ROUND_OR ($1B1E) 4: the
#   next head turn's list ($18) gives 4, the turn table's third word
#   ($84:88D5).
